  designNotes: "Beat 6: stage boss. The first BossPhaseTrigger the project has ever
    fired \u2014 the keep falling spawns the Citadel Sovereign (260 hp) and a heavy
    escort, so the level does not end when the structure does. Biome reuses Mountains
    from beat 1 on purpose: same ground, a fortress instead of a hut, which is the
    clearest possible read on how far the player has come.
    Structure hp RETUNED 2026-08-07: bunker and keep both hpScale 0.66 (180 -> 118, 212 ->
    139), garrisoned total 392 -> 257. Scaled TOGETHER so the keep stays the dominant
    structure; 257 leaves a stage boss less slack than the levels before it, which is the
    point."
